        "exact": "174 sıra sayılı Kanun Teklifi'nin açık oylama sonucu: </span></p><p style=\"margin:0pt 2pt; text-indent:40.3pt; text-align:justify; font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">“Kullanılan Oy Sayısı </span><span style=\"width:69.61pt; text-indent:0pt; font-family:Arial; display:inline-block; -aw-tabstop-align:left; -aw-tabstop-pos:198.45pt\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: 320 </span></p><p style=\"margin:0pt 2pt; text-indent:40.3pt; text-align:justify; font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Kabul </span><span style=\"width:130.63pt; text-indent:0pt; font-family:Arial; display:inline-block; -aw-tabstop-align:left; -aw-tabstop-pos:198.45pt\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: 247 </span></p><p style=\"margin:0pt 2pt; text-indent:40.3pt; text-align:justify; font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ret </span><span style=\"width:139.64pt; text-indent:0pt; font-family:Arial; display:inline-block; -aw-tabstop-align:left; -aw-tabstop-pos:198.45pt\">&#xa0;</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">: 73 </span><a name=\"_ftnref3\"></a><a href=\"#_ftn3\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial; font-size:6pt; vertical-align:super; color:#000000\">[3]</span></a></p><p style=\"margin:0pt 2pt; text-indent:40.3pt; text-align:justify; font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"-aw-import:ignore\">&#xa0;</span></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:528.75pt; margin-right:auto; margin-left:auto; border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"width:33.34%; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; font-size:9pt\"><span>Kâtip Üye</span></p></td><td style=\"width:33.34%; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; font-size:9pt\"><span>Kâtip Üye</span></p></td><td style=\"width:33.34%; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"-aw-import:spaces\">&#xa0;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:33.34%; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; font-size:9pt\"><span>Mustafa Bilici</span></p></td><td style=\"width:33.34%; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; font-size:9pt\"><span>Rümeysa Kadak</span></p></td><td style=\"width:33.34%; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"-aw-import:spaces\">&#xa0;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:33.34%; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; font-size:9pt\"><span>İzmir</span></p></td><td style=\"width:33.34%; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; font-size:9pt\"><span>İstanbul\"</span></p></td><td style=\"width:33.34%; padding-right:5.4pt; padding-left:5.4pt; vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:center; font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"-aw-import:spaces\">&#xa0;</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p style=\"margin:0pt 2pt; text-indent:40.3pt; text-align:justify; font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"-aw-import:ignore\">&#xa0;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0pt 2pt; text-indent:40.3pt; text-align:justify; font-size:9pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">BAŞKAN - Teklif kabul edilmiş ve kanunlaşmıştır.",
